%% Anomaly escalation sequence
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant G as Edge Gateway
    participant I as IoT Core
    participant L1 as ingest_handler
    participant L2 as anomaly_processor
    participant DB as DynamoDB
    participant L3 as alert_dispatcher
    participant S as SNS
    participant U as Caregiver

    G->>G: 10s window → TFLite → reconstruction error e
    alt e < tau_low
        G->>I: summary only (~200 B)
        I->>L1: rule invoke
        L1->>DB: PutItem Telemetry
    else e >= tau_high
        G->>I: summary + full window (QoS 1)
        I->>L1: rule invoke
        L1->>DB: PutItem Telemetry
        L1->>L2: async invoke
        L2->>L2: confirmation model + rule cross-check
        L2->>DB: PutItem Alert
        L2->>L3: async invoke
        L3->>S: Publish (deduped)
        S->>U: email / SMS  (target < 5 s end to end)
    end
